{"file": "1-Perustaso/Linnasmaki-Askelia-2/3_Asuntonaytossa.mp3", "duration": 94.62, "segments": [{"start": 3.48, "end": 4.48, "text": "Hei!", "words": [{"w": "Hei!", "s": 3.48, "e": 4.48}]}, {"start": 4.92, "end": 8.16, "text": "Hei! Tervetuloa, Aki Nieminen.", "words": [{"w": "Hei!", "s": 4.92, "e": 5.9}, {"w": "Tervetuloa,", "s": 6.18, "e": 7.14}, {"w": "Aki", "s": 7.5, "e": 7.72}, {"w": "Nieminen.", "s": 7.72, "e": 8.16}]}, {"start": 8.32, "end": 9.18, "text": "Elina Ahonen.", "words": [{"w": "Elina", "s": 8.32, "e": 8.82}, {"w": "Ahonen.", "s": 8.82, "e": 9.18}]}, {"start": 10.54, "end": 14.06, "text": "Tämä on tosiaan tällainen kaksio 45 neljätä.", "words": [{"w": "Tämä", "s": 10.32, "e": 10.82}, {"w": "on", "s": 10.82, "e": 10.98}, {"w": "tosiaan", "s": 10.98, "e": 11.36}, {"w": "tällainen", "s": 11.36, "e": 11.72}, {"w": "kaksio", "s": 11.72, "e": 12.62}, {"w": "45", "s": 12.62, "e": 13.28}, {"w": "neljätä.", "s": 13.28, "e": 14.06}]}, {"start": 14.94, "end": 16.84, "text": "Sauna ja parveke löytyy.", "words": [{"w": "Sauna", "s": 14.94, "e": 15.38}, {"w": "ja", "s": 15.38, "e": 15.5}, {"w": "parveke", "s": 15.5, "e": 15.92}, {"w": "löytyy.", "s": 15.92, "e": 16.84}]}, {"start": 17.3, "end": 20.52, "text": "Ja vuokra on 550 euroa kuussa.", "words": [{"w": "Ja", "s": 17.3, "e": 17.84}, {"w": "vuokra", "s": 17.84, "e": 18.34}, {"w": "on", "s": 18.34, "e": 18.56}, {"w": "550", "s": 18.56, "e": 19.3}, {"w": "euroa", "s": 19.3, "e": 20.08}, {"w": "kuussa.", "s": 20.08, "e": 20.52}]}, {"start": 21.14, "end": 25.02, "text": "Näyttää kivalta, mutta keitti on tosi pieni.", "words": [{"w": "Näyttää", "s": 21.14, "e": 21.64}, {"w": "kivalta,", "s": 21.64, "e": 22.34}, {"w": "mutta", "s": 22.46, "e": 22.66}, {"w": "keitti", "s": 22.66, "e": 23.64}, {"w": "on", "s": 23.64, "e": 23.86}, {"w": "tosi", "s": 23.86, "e": 24.38}, {"w": "pieni.", "s": 24.38, "e": 25.02}]}, {"start": 25.4, "end": 27.7, "text": "Maksaako vesi ja sähkö erikseen?", "words": [{"w": "Maksaako", "s": 25.4, "e": 26.28}, {"w": "vesi", "s": 26.28, "e": 26.58}, {"w": "ja", "s": 26.58, "e": 26.7}, {"w": "sähkö", "s": 26.7, "e": 27.08}, {"w": "erikseen?", "s": 27.08, "e": 27.7}]}, {"start": 28.7, "end": 37.18, "text": "Vesimaksu on 18 euroa kuussa yhdeltä henkilöltä. Sähkö laskutetaan kulutuksen mukaan. Nettiyhteys kuuluu vuokraan.", "words": [{"w": "Vesimaksu", "s": 28.7, "e": 29.42}, {"w": "on", "s": 29.42, "e": 29.48}, {"w": "18", "s": 29.48, "e": 29.76}, {"w": "euroa", "s": 29.76, "e": 30.48}, {"w": "kuussa", "s": 30.48, "e": 30.86}, {"w": "yhdeltä", "s": 30.86, "e": 31.38}, {"w": "henkilöltä.", "s": 31.38, "e": 32.04}, {"w": "Sähkö", "s": 32.26, "e": 33.26}, {"w": "laskutetaan", "s": 33.26, "e": 33.8}, {"w": "kulutuksen", "s": 33.8, "e": 34.5}, {"w": "mukaan.", "s": 34.5, "e": 34.98}, {"w": "Nettiyhteys", "s": 35.54, "e": 36.28}, {"w": "kuuluu", "s": 36.28, "e": 36.66}, {"w": "vuokraan.", "s": 36.66, "e": 37.18}]}, {"start": 37.26, "end": 40.12, "text": "Tosi hyvä. Milloin tämä vapautuu?", "words": [{"w": "Tosi", "s": 37.26, "e": 37.54}, {"w": "hyvä.", "s": 37.54, "e": 37.86}, {"w": "Milloin", "s": 38.54, "e": 39.26}, {"w": "tämä", "s": 39.26, "e": 39.46}, {"w": "vapautuu?", "s": 39.46, "e": 40.12}]}, {"start": 40.9, "end": 45.92, "text": "Tämä on vapaa huhtikuun alusta, eli ensimmäinen päivä huhtikuuta voi muuttaa.", "words": [{"w": "Tämä", "s": 40.9, "e": 41.4}, {"w": "on", "s": 41.4, "e": 41.54}, {"w": "vapaa", "s": 41.54, "e": 41.86}, {"w": "huhtikuun", "s": 41.86, "e": 42.56}, {"w": "alusta,", "s": 42.56, "e": 42.98}, {"w": "eli", "s": 43.2, "e": 43.92}, {"w": "ensimmäinen", "s": 43.92, "e": 44.44}, {"w": "päivä", "s": 44.44, "e": 44.68}, {"w": "huhtikuuta", "s": 44.68, "e": 45.22}, {"w": "voi", "s": 45.22, "e": 45.42}, {"w": "muuttaa.", "s": 45.42, "e": 45.92}]}, {"start": 46.44, "end": 48.52, "text": "Kuinka suuri takuvuokra tässä on?", "words": [{"w": "Kuinka", "s": 46.44, "e": 46.8}, {"w": "suuri", "s": 46.8, "e": 47.1}, {"w": "takuvuokra", "s": 47.1, "e": 47.88}, {"w": "tässä", "s": 47.88, "e": 48.2}, {"w": "on?", "s": 48.2, "e": 48.52}]}, {"start": 49.8, "end": 54.26, "text": "Takuvuokra on kahden kuukauden vuokra, eli yhteensä 1100 euroa.", "words": [{"w": "Takuvuokra", "s": 49.8, "e": 50.48}, {"w": "on", "s": 50.48, "e": 50.62}, {"w": "kahden", "s": 50.62, "e": 51.06}, {"w": "kuukauden", "s": 51.06, "e": 51.58}, {"w": "vuokra,", "s": 51.58, "e": 52.2}, {"w": "eli", "s": 52.46, "e": 52.52}, {"w": "yhteensä", "s": 52.52, "e": 53.02}, {"w": "1100", "s": 53.02, "e": 53.64}, {"w": "euroa.", "s": 53.64, "e": 54.26}]}, {"start": 54.92, "end": 58.18, "text": "Sen saat sitten tietysti takaisin, kun vuokrasuhde päättyy.", "words": [{"w": "Sen", "s": 54.92, "e": 55.1}, {"w": "saat", "s": 55.1, "e": 55.32}, {"w": "sitten", "s": 55.32, "e": 55.64}, {"w": "tietysti", "s": 55.64, "e": 56.08}, {"w": "takaisin,", "s": 56.08, "e": 56.66}, {"w": "kun", "s": 56.72, "e": 56.78}, {"w": "vuokrasuhde", "s": 56.78, "e": 57.4}, {"w": "päättyy.", "s": 57.4, "e": 58.18}]}, {"start": 58.36, "end": 60.06, "text": "Siis jos asunnossa on kaikki kunnossa.", "words": [{"w": "Siis", "s": 58.36, "e": 58.68}, {"w": "jos", "s": 58.68, "e": 58.8}, {"w": "asunnossa", "s": 58.8, "e": 59.24}, {"w": "on", "s": 59.24, "e": 59.36}, {"w": "kaikki", "s": 59.36, "e": 59.6}, {"w": "kunnossa.", "s": 59.6, "e": 60.06}]}, {"start": 60.36, "end": 63.04, "text": "Joo, totta kai. Se ei ole ongelma.", "words": [{"w": "Joo,", "s": 60.36, "e": 60.7}, {"w": "totta", "s": 60.94, "e": 61.24}, {"w": "kai.", "s": 61.24, "e": 61.5}, {"w": "Se", "s": 61.64, "e": 62.14}, {"w": "ei", "s": 62.14, "e": 62.28}, {"w": "ole", "s": 62.28, "e": 62.44}, {"w": "ongelma.", "s": 62.44, "e": 63.04}]}, {"start": 63.36, "end": 67.4, "text": "Mutta vielä tärkeä kysymys. Saako koira myös muuttaa?", "words": [{"w": "Mutta", "s": 63.36, "e": 64.02}, {"w": "vielä", "s": 64.02, "e": 64.32}, {"w": "tärkeä", "s": 64.32, "e": 64.86}, {"w": "kysymys.", "s": 64.86, "e": 65.42}, {"w": "Saako", "s": 65.58, "e": 66.04}, {"w": "koira", "s": 66.04, "e": 66.48}, {"w": "myös", "s": 66.48, "e": 66.8}, {"w": "muuttaa?", "s": 66.8, "e": 67.4}]}, {"start": 68.18, "end": 71.7, "text": "Saa toki. Meillä ei ole mitään rajoituksia eläinten suhteen.", "words": [{"w": "Saa", "s": 68.18, "e": 68.76}, {"w": "toki.", "s": 68.76, "e": 69.12}, {"w": "Meillä", "s": 69.34, "e": 69.64}, {"w": "ei", "s": 69.64, "e": 69.74}, {"w": "ole", "s": 69.74, "e": 69.88}, {"w": "mitään", "s": 69.88, "e": 70.2}, {"w": "rajoituksia", "s": 70.2, "e": 70.84}, {"w": "eläinten", "s": 70.84, "e": 71.3}, {"w": "suhteen.", "s": 71.3, "e": 71.7}]}, {"start": 72.08, "end": 75.16, "text": "Loistavaa. Kyllä mä haluaisin vuokrata tämän.", "words": [{"w": "Loistavaa.", "s": 72.08, "e": 72.76}, {"w": "Kyllä", "s": 73.28, "e": 73.6}, {"w": "mä", "s": 73.6, "e": 73.72}, {"w": "haluaisin", "s": 73.72, "e": 74.26}, {"w": "vuokrata", "s": 74.26, "e": 74.74}, {"w": "tämän.", "s": 74.74, "e": 75.16}]}, {"start": 75.16, "end": 80.24, "text": "Onko vuokrasopimus määräaikainen vai toistaiseksi voimassa oleva?", "words": [{"w": "Onko", "s": 75.16, "e": 76.38}, {"w": "vuokrasopimus", "s": 76.38, "e": 77.3}, {"w": "määräaikainen", "s": 77.3, "e": 78.22}, {"w": "vai", "s": 78.22, "e": 78.46}, {"w": "toistaiseksi", "s": 78.46, "e": 79.28}, {"w": "voimassa", "s": 79.28, "e": 79.8}, {"w": "oleva?", "s": 79.8, "e": 80.24}]}, {"start": 81.1, "end": 84.9, "text": "Me voidaan tehdä ihan toistaiseksi voimassa oleva sopimus.", "words": [{"w": "Me", "s": 81.02, "e": 81.56}, {"w": "voidaan", "s": 81.56, "e": 82.02}, {"w": "tehdä", "s": 82.02, "e": 82.48}, {"w": "ihan", "s": 82.48, "e": 82.68}, {"w": "toistaiseksi", "s": 82.68, "e": 83.5}, {"w": "voimassa", "s": 83.5, "e": 84.0}, {"w": "oleva", "s": 84.0, "e": 84.28}, {"w": "sopimus.", "s": 84.28, "e": 84.9}]}, {"start": 85.7, "end": 89.16, "text": "Silloin irtisanomisaika on sinun puoleltasi yksi kokonainen kalenterikuukausi.", "words": [{"w": "Silloin", "s": 85.46, "e": 86.0}, {"w": "irtisanomisaika", "s": 86.0, "e": 86.86}, {"w": "on", "s": 86.86, "e": 87.02}, {"w": "sinun", "s": 87.02, "e": 87.34}, {"w": "puoleltasi", "s": 87.34, "e": 87.9}, {"w": "yksi", "s": 87.9, "e": 88.2}, {"w": "kokonainen", "s": 88.2, "e": 88.76}, {"w": "kalenterikuukausi.", "s": 88.76, "e": 89.3}]}, {"start": 89.96, "end": 93.26, "text": "Kuulostaa hyvältä. Kirjoitetaan vuokrasopimus.", "words": [{"w": "Kuulostaa", "s": 89.96, "e": 90.56}, {"w": "hyvältä.", "s": 90.56, "e": 91.22}, {"w": "Kirjoitetaan", "s": 91.6, "e": 92.26}, {"w": "vuokrasopimus.", "s": 92.26, "e": 93.26}]}]}